{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifters Don't Brake: Midnight</strong> is a Top-down Arcade Racer where the car is always accelerating and you must navigate through different terrains by <i>drifting</i>. How many attempts will you need in order to beat all the challenging levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/35ae58c2eff6439e8274d1906451bae3.poster.avif?t=1766952016\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/35ae58c2eff6439e8274d1906451bae3.webm?t=1766952016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/35ae58c2eff6439e8274d1906451bae3.mp4?t=1766952016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Brakes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no brake mechanic in the game, you'll have to think fast and drift your way through the levels. Any mistake might ruin your run.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage includes at least one game mode. A game mode is a modifier that alters the stage\u2019s objectives, rules, and/or core mechanics.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Terrains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to adapt your drifting techniques to drive over different terrains. The terrains can cause the car to drift more or less, as well as interfere on the car speed or controls</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/39613ae16221349aacafb9588a2413f5.poster.avif?t=1766952016\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/39613ae16221349aacafb9588a2413f5.webm?t=1766952016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/39613ae16221349aacafb9588a2413f5.mp4?t=1766952016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the car shape, color, window color, and decals to create a more personalized design.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show everyone how fast you can be on different levels of the game.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/21ef49c929c8227dcae4eb13acbb1eee.poster.avif?t=1766952016\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/21ef49c929c8227dcae4eb13acbb1eee.webm?t=1766952016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/21ef49c929c8227dcae4eb13acbb1eee.mp4?t=1766952016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491670?t=1766952016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491